tely excluded (no rows invented for it): the eight `#if !defined(PNG_WRITE_*_SUPPORTED)` warnings in `png_write_row` (`pngwrite.c:766-800`), the `#else png_warning(\"Unable to write international/compressed/uncompressed text\")` fallbacks, and the `#else png_app_error(\"PNG_TRANSFORM_* not supported\")` arms in `png_write_png` — all transforms and text chunk writers are enabled in this config.\n\n## Notable gaps in the C (rows record these as \"no check exists\")\n\n- `png_write_eXIf` (`pngwutil.c:1516`) validates nothing: negative `num_exif` becomes a huge chunk length; `exif == NULL` dereferences NULL.\n- `png_write_tIME` checks month/day/hour/second but **not `minute`**.\n- `png_write_sRGB`, `png_write_oFFs`, `png_write_pHYs` warn on out-of-range values but **still write the chunk** with the bad byte.\n- `png_set_compression_method` / `png_set_text_compression_method` warn on `method != 8` but store the bad value anyway, deferring the failure to `deflateInit2`.\n- `png_do_pack`'s `default:` case (`pngwtran.c:150`) skips packing yet still overwrites `row_info->bit_depth`/`pixel_depth`/`rowbytes`, which later trips `\"internal write transform logic error\"`.\n- `pngwutil.c:1147` (`\"Profile length does not match profile\"`) is an unreachable duplicate of the check at `1137`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":666,"cache_read_input_tokens":160596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":666,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01AjT3dy5nMrhtmNyx1ijYdC","session_id":"d61bc42a-4e8d-424f-b737-52a7165119c7","uuid":"c8031aac-1085-4408-afde-6ce9981854a9","timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:31:09.030Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"ERRORS table: write paths"}
