= 2/*required*/`, `mode = PNG_ALPHA_PNG`\n  - else stays 1\n- `(change & FLAG_LINEAR) != 0 && linear != 0` -> `png_set_expand_16`\n- `(change & FLAG_LINEAR) != 0 && linear == 0` -> `png_set_scale_16`; **and `png_ptr->interlaced != 0` -> `do_local_scale = 1`** (CVE-hardening for png_combine_row overflow)\n- `(change & FLAG_ALPHA) != 0 && (base_format & FLAG_ALPHA) != 0` (removing alpha):\n  - `do_local_background != 0` -> `do_local_background = 2`\n  - `linear != 0` -> `png_set_strip_alpha` (premultiply already done)\n  - `display->background != NULL` -> build `png_color_16` from `background->red/green/blue` (`gray = green`) + `png_set_background_fixed(SCREEN, need_expand=0)`\n  - `display->background == NULL` -> `do_local_compose = 1`, `mode = PNG_ALPHA_OPTIMIZED` (compose on the caller's existing row content)\n- `(change & FLAG_ALPHA) != 0 && no input alpha` (adding alpha): `filler = linear ? 65535 : 255`; `AFIRST_SUPPORTED && (format & FLAG_AFIRST) != 0` -> `where = PNG_FILLER_BEFORE` + clear AFIRST from change; else `PNG_FILLER_AFTER`; `png_set_add_alpha`\n- then always clear `FLAG_ALPHA` from change; `png_set_alpha_mode_fixed(mode, output_gamma)`\n- `BGR_SUPPORTED && (change & FLAG_BGR) != 0 && (format & FLAG_COLOR) != 0` -> `png_set_bgr`; `output gray` -> `format &= ~FLAG_BGR` (silently drop)\n- `AFIRST_SUPPORTED && (change & FLAG_AFIRST) != 0 && (format & FLAG_ALPHA) != 0 && do_local_background != 2` -> `png_set_swap_alpha`\n- `(change & FLAG_AFIRST) != 0 && (format & FLAG_ALPHA) != 0 && do_local_background == 2` -> **no** swap_alpha (handled locally)\n- `(change & FLAG_AFIRST) != 0 && no output alpha` -> `format &= ~FLAG_AFIRST`\n- `linear != 0 && host is little-endian (*(png_const_bytep)&le)` -> `png_set_swap`\n- `change != 0` after all -> `png_error(\"png_read_image: unsupported transformation\")`\n- `PNG_SKIP_CHUNKS(png_ptr)`\n- `do_local_compose == 0 && do_local_background != 2` -> `passes = png_set_interlace_handling()`; else `passes` stays 0\n- always `