X-48-1)/8)-1`; `width > user_width_max`(or PNG_USER_WIDTH_MAX); `height == 0`; `height > PNG_UINT_31_MAX`; `height > user_height_max`; `bit_depth ∉ {1,2,4,8,16}`; `color_type < 0 || ==1 || ==5 || >6`; `(color_type==PALETTE && bit_depth>8) || ((RGB|GRAY_ALPHA|RGB_ALPHA) && bit_depth<8)`; `interlace_type >= PNG_INTERLACE_LAST`; plus compression/filter type checks — each sets `error=1`\n- legal matrix therefore: GRAY×{1,2,4,8,16}; PALETTE×{1,2,4,8}; RGB/GRAY_ALPHA/RGB_ALPHA×{8,16}\n- always `mode |= PNG_HAVE_IHDR`; returns `handled_ok`\n\n### png_handle_PLTE (980)\n- `(mode & PNG_HAVE_PLTE) != 0` -> errmsg \"duplicate\"\n- `(mode & PNG_HAVE_IDAT) != 0` -> \"out of place\"\n- `(color_type & PNG_COLOR_MASK_COLOR) == 0` -> \"ignored in grayscale PNG\"\n- `length > 3*PNG_MAX_PALETTE_LENGTH || (length % 3) != 0` -> \"invalid\"\n- `color_type != PALETTE && (png_has_chunk(tRNS) || png_has_chunk(bKGD))` -> \"out of place\"\n- success: `max_palette_length = (color_type==PALETTE) ? 1U << bit_depth : PNG_MAX_PALETTE_LENGTH` — i.e. bit_depth 1/2/4/8 -> 2/4/16/256 entries\n- `length > 3U*max_palette_length` -> `num = max_palette_length` (silent truncation); else `num = length/3`\n- reads `num*3` then `png_crc_finish_critical(length - 3*num, color_type != PALETTE)` (PLTE treated ancillary for non-palette images)\n- error path, `color_type == PALETTE` -> `png_crc_finish(length)` + `png_chunk_error` (fatal)\n- error path, otherwise -> `png_crc_finish_critical(length, 1)` + `png_chunk_benign_error`\n- No `PNG_READ_OPT_PLTE` conditional exists here; optionality is expressed via the `handle_as_ancillary` argument\n- table `CDPLTE = NoCheck,0,0,hIHDR,1` (multiple permitted, no length check)\n\n### png_handle_IEND (1084)\n- always `mode |= (PNG_AFTER_IDAT | PNG_HAVE_IEND)`\n- `length != 0` -> `png_chunk_benign_error(\"invalid\")` (historically data allowed)\n- always `png_crc_finish_critical(length, 1/*ancillary*/)`; returns handled_ok\n- table `CDIEND = NoCheck,0,0,aIDAT,0`\n\n### png_han