` — **`fp == NULL` is accepted silently**; failure surfaces later in `png_default_read_data`/`png_default_write_data` as an fread/fwrite on NULL.\n\n## png_save_int_32 (png.c:731)\n175. Single configuration: `png_save_uint_32(buf, (png_uint_32)i)`; negative `i` → 2's-complement encoding. (`png_save_uint_32`/`png_save_uint_16` themselves live in **pngwutil.c:41/54**, not png.c. `png_get_uint_31/32/16` and `png_get_int_32` live in **pngrutil.c:41/63/98/80**.)\n\n## png_convert_to_rfc1123_buffer (png.c:742)\n176. `out == NULL` → return 0.\n177. `ptime->year > 9999` → return 0.\n178. `month == 0` → return 0. 179. `month > 12` → return 0.\n180. `day == 0` → return 0. 181. `day > 31` → return 0.\n182. `hour > 23` → return 0. 183. `minute > 59` → return 0. 184. `second > 60` (60 allowed for leap second) → return 0.\n185. All in range → formats `\"D Mon YYYY HH:MM:SS +0000\"` into 29-byte buffer via `png_safecat`/`PNG_FORMAT_NUMBER`; the `APPEND(ch)` macro is guarded by `pos < 28`; returns 1.\n186. `ptime == NULL` → **dereferenced without check** (crash).\n187. `png_convert_to_rfc1123` (deprecated wrapper, `PNG_LIBPNG_VER < 10700`): `png_ptr == NULL` → NULL; buffer conversion fails → `png_warning(\"Ignoring invalid time value\")` + NULL; success → `png_ptr->time_buffer`.\n188. `png_convert_from_time_t` / `png_convert_from_struct_tm` are **not in png.c** — they are in pngwrite.c:508/521.\n\n## Version/copyright accessors\n189. `png_get_copyright`: two compile-time configurations (`PNG_STRING_COPYRIGHT` defined vs the built-in multi-line string). `png_ptr` unused, NULL safe.\n190. `png_get_libpng_ver` → tail-calls `png_get_header_ver`.\n191. `png_get_header_ver` → `PNG_LIBPNG_VER_STRING`, NULL-safe.\n192. `png_get_header_version`: `__STDC__` defined → `PNG_HEADER_VERSION_STRING` (+ `\" (NO READ SUPPORT)\"` when `!PNG_READ_SUPPORTED`) + newline; else bare string.\n193. `png_access_version_number` → constant `PNG_LIBPNG_VER`; no inputs.\n\n## png_build_grayscale_palette (png.c: