288. `height > user_height_max` → \"Image height exceeds user limit in IHDR\".\n289. `bit_depth ∉ {1,2,4,8,16}` → \"Invalid bit depth in IHDR\".\n290. `color_type < 0 || == 1 || == 5 || > 6` → \"Invalid color type in IHDR\".\n291. `color_type == 3 && bit_depth > 8` → \"Invalid color type/bit depth combination in IHDR\".\n292. `color_type ∈ {2,4,6} && bit_depth < 8` → same warning.\n293. `interlace_type >= PNG_INTERLACE_LAST` → \"Unknown interlace method in IHDR\".\n294. `compression_type != PNG_COMPRESSION_TYPE_BASE` → \"Unknown compression method in IHDR\".\n295. MNG build: `(mode & PNG_HAVE_PNG_SIGNATURE) != 0 && mng_features_permitted != 0` → warning \"MNG features are not allowed in a PNG datastream\" (does **not** set error).\n296. MNG build, `filter_type != PNG_FILTER_TYPE_BASE` && NOT(`mng_features_permitted & PNG_FLAG_MNG_FILTER_64` && `filter_type == PNG_INTRAPIXEL_DIFFERENCING` && no PNG signature && `color_type ∈ {2,6}`) → \"Unknown filter method in IHDR\", error.\n297. MNG build, `filter_type != BASE && (mode & PNG_HAVE_PNG_SIGNATURE) != 0` → additional \"Invalid filter method in IHDR\", error.\n298. non-MNG build, `filter_type != PNG_FILTER_TYPE_BASE` → \"Unknown filter method in IHDR\", error.\n299. `error == 1` at the end → `png_error(\"Invalid IHDR data\")`; `error == 0` → returns normally.\n300. NOTE: there is **no `png_check_chunk_length` in this tree** (grep finds none); the chunk-length limiting is `png_chunk_max()` used in pngrutil.c and at png.c:1606.\n\n## png_check_fp_number (png.c:2134) — state machine\nCharacter classes: 301. `'+'(43)` → SAW_SIGN. 302. `'-'(45)` → SAW_SIGN|NEGATIVE. 303. `'.'(46)` → SAW_DOT. 304. `'0'(48)` → SAW_DIGIT. 305. `'1'..'9'` → SAW_DIGIT|NONZERO. 306. `'E'(69)/'e'(101)` → SAW_E. 307. anything else → terminate scan at `i`.\nState×class transitions:\n308. INTEGER+SIGN with `state & SAW_ANY` already set → stop (sign not part of number). 309. INTEGER+SIGN, nothing seen → accept.\n310. INTEGER+DOT with SAW_DOT already →