point number - the standard argument - to\n2766- * the nearest .00001).  Overflow and divide by zero are signalled in\n2767- * the result, a boolean - true on success, false on overflow.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01ULCxkZD4zFb42w4dLYkpGA","session_id":"d61bc42a-4e8d-424f-b737-52a7165119c7","uuid":"35e90095-d19b-4689-beb3-e7afd52e5c47","timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:58:41.683Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write info set/get roundtrip tests"}
