or greater than zero if sig is found,\n * respectively, to be less than, to match, or be greater than the correct\n * PNG signature (this is the same behavior as strcmp, memcmp, etc).\n */\nint PNGAPI\npng_sig_cmp(png_const_bytep sig, size_t start, size_t num_to_check)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01H4bkgNE6Ud9yVg834dhBsz","session_id":"d61bc42a-4e8d-424f-b737-52a7165119c7","uuid":"21c756c2-d07d-4041-974f-e40c16e280e2","timestamp":"2026-09-04T04:10:06.626Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write setter/transform error tests"}
