and `-1`.\n- **EASY_ACCESS**: all 18 derivative getters with the chunk present, absent, with each unit type, and after the flag is forcibly cleared.\n- **State/pointers**: io/error/mem/progressive/user_chunk/user_transform pointers (compared as `NULL`/`EQ`/`OTHER`), io_state, io_chunk_type, user limits, chunk cache/malloc max (incl. `0`→`PNG_SIZE_MAX`), compression buffer size, pass/row number, rgb_to_gray_status.\n- **`png_free_data`/`png_data_freer`**: all 12 `PNG_FREE_*` masks × `num = -1, 0, 1, 2` × both freer values.\n- **Allocation**: `png_info_init_3` (size 0 → realloc path, and large → memset), create/destroy info struct, `png_create_{read,write}_struct_2` with a custom bump allocator, `png_malloc`/`calloc`/`malloc_warn`/`malloc_default`/`free`/`free_default`. Allocator balance is `live_after_destroy:0` in both libraries (no leak). (`png_malloc_array` is not exported, so it is not in `tests/common/api.rs`; likewise `png_set_text_2` is `PRIVATE`.)\n- **Options/misc**: `png_set_option` for options −2..18 × 4 on/off values (read back twice), `png_permit_mng_features`, `png_set_benign_errors`, `png_set_check_for_invalid_index`→`png_get_palette_max`, `png_set_keep_unknown_chunks` (all 4 keeps × default/list-A/list-B/all-known/reset) probed with `png_handle_as_unknown` over 14 names, `png_set_sig_bytes` 0..8 + `png_get_signature`, all compression/text-compression setters, `png_set_filter` (12 masks + MNG method 64), `png_set_filter_heuristics(_fixed)`, `png_set_flush`, read/write status fns, `png_set_interlace_handling` (1 fresh, 7 after `png_write_info` on ADAM7).\n- **Full-write byte comparison** (`t_compression_output`): 33 combinations of level/mem_level/strategy/window_bits/buffer_size/filters/text-compression settings, comparing the complete output stream byte-for-byte (lengths observed 170–759, so the settings genuinely change the bytes and both libraries agree).\n- **Warn-and-continue paths** (`t_benign_warning_paths`, after `png_set_benign_errors(p,1)`): 