{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01SsgTte8BYzJkSXTTJM4uyJ","type":"tool_result","content":"## How the rows are tested\n\nEvery row is covered by a differential test in `tests/` that calls BOTH\nlibraries through their `.so` exports and compares the results byte-for-byte:\n\n| test file | scope |\n|---|---|\n| `t01_low_level.rs` | pure/scalar helpers: byte order, `png_sig_cmp`, `png_muldiv`, reciprocals, gamma helpers, `png_XYZ_from_xy`/`png_xy_from_XYZ`, `png_safecat`, `png_format_number`, `png_check_fp_*`, `png_ascii_from_*`, `png_fixed(_ITU)`, grayscale palette, time conversion |\n| `t02_write.rs` | the whole write pipeline: `png_write_info`/`_row`/`_rows`/`_image`/`_end`/`_flush`, `png_write_png`, every filter subset, every zlib option, every write transform, every ancillary chunk, text chunks, unknown chunks, MNG features, the raw `png_write_chunk*` API |\n| `t03_read.rs` | the whole read pipeline: `png_read_info`/`_update_info`/`_row`/`_rows`/`_image`/`_end`, `png_read_png`, the progressive reader at every feed size, every read transform alone and in combination, gamma/background/alpha-mode/rgb-to-gray/quantize, every ancillary chunk, all options and limits |\n| `t04_simplified.rs` | the simplified API: `png_image_begin_read_from_memory`/`_from_file`/`_from_stdio`, `png_image_finish_read` for every `PNG_FORMAT_*` and `PNG_IMAGE_FLAG_*`, `png_image_write_to_memory`/`_to_file`/`_to_stdio`, colormapped and not, both row-stride signs |\n| `t05_info.rs` | every `png_set_*` / `png_get_*` pair round-tripped, `png_get_valid`/`png_set_invalid`, `png_free_data`/`png_data_freer`, the EASY_ACCESS getters, `png_info_init_3`, memory callbacks |\n| `t20_err_*.rs` | the `ERRORS.md` rows (Phase C) |\n\nThe `covered by` column is ticked `[x]` when the row's differential test passes across the\nrandomised inputs of its test.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d61bc42a-4e8d-424f-b737-52a7165119c7","uuid":"a02db